  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-religion-spirituality</b></p><a name=\"ahip-religion-spirituality\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-religion-spirituality\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ReligiousAffiliation</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 3.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?3.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1006\">1006</a></td><td>Animism</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1004\">1004</a></td><td>Agnostic (not sure if there is a God)​</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1007\">1007</a></td><td>Atheist (do not believe in God)​</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1008\">1008</a></td><td>Baha'I</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1059\">1059</a></td><td>Buddhism</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1043\">1043</a></td><td>Church of Scientology</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1014\">1014</a></td><td>Confucianism</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1020\">1020</a></td><td>Hinduism</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1021\">1021</a></td><td>Humanism</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1023\">1023</a></td><td>Islam,Nation of Islam (Muslim)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1025\">1025</a></td><td>Jehovah's Witnesses</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1026\">1026</a></td><td>Judaism (Jewish)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1027\">1027</a></td><td>Mormonism (Church of Jesus Christ of Latterday Saints/LDS)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1037\">1037</a></td><td>Paganism</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1044\">1044</a></td><td>Shamanism</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1047\">1047</a></td><td>Sikhism</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1050\">1050</a></td><td>Taoism</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1052\">1052</a></td><td>Unitarian Universalist</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1056\">1056</a></td><td>VooDoo</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-ReligiousAffiliation.html#v3-ReligiousAffiliation-1060\">1060</a></td><td>Zoroastrianism</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-religion-codes</code><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>CHRI</td><td>Christianity (e.g. Protestant, Roman Catholic, Russian Orthodox, Seventh-day Adventist)</td></tr><tr><td>OBEA</td><td>Obeahism</td></tr><tr><td>SBNR</td><td>Spiritual but not religious</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 3.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?3.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>Asked but unknown</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
